# Docker build context exclusions for SocketSpace v2
# v1 is archived and must never enter a v2 image
v1/

# Dependencies, build output and caches are rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.cache

# Secrets and local files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
docs
qa
*.md
!**/README.md
